steps-informal.p:
To do this, create a custom CSS file that specifies the
            folding:section{
    -oxy-foldable:true;
    -oxy-not-foldable-child: title;
}

To further improve performance, configure elements to be folded by
            default. Users must manually unfold these
            elements:section{
    -oxy-folded: true;
}
